cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, methodology, or published search records, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "SETIsearch: Panchromatic (0.38-2.48 um) Echelle, Radio & Photometric Technosignature Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Prospectively locked, reproducible archival searches and pure-stdlib numerical audits
  for panchromatic optical, near-infrared YJH, and thermal K-band laser technosignatures
  (0.38-2.48 um across ESO HARPS, VLT ESPRESSO, ESO NIRPS, VLT CRIRES+, TNG HARPS-N,
  Calar Alto CARMENES_VIS, and FEROS; 125 unique stars and 832 high-resolution echelle
  exposures totaling 180.82 h in V3.0-V3.5 with Keplerian planetary de-Doppler, 2D CCD/H2RG
  vetoes, and automated G6_V35 cross-star coincidence gating), unified with
  planetary-rest-frame 1.4 GHz narrowband radio searches (Parkes/GBT) and TESS specular
  light-sail photometry into a 136-system all-sky multi-messenger synthesis.
authors:
  - family-names: "Andersen"
    given-names: "Martin"
version: 0.10.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
